# Changes to the rules, the checks, and the test setup need human review.
# Replace @your-handle. Enforcing this needs branch protection or a ruleset with "Require
# review from Code Owners", which private repos only get on paid plans (see README).
# Patterns without a leading / match at any depth, so monorepo apps (web/, agent/) count.
AGENTS.md                   @your-handle
CLAUDE.md                   @your-handle
SECURITY.md                 @your-handle
/.verify.env                @your-handle
/scripts/                   @your-handle
/.github/                   @your-handle
/.agent/learnings.md        @your-handle
/.claude/                   @your-handle
/.agents/                   @your-handle
/.codex/                    @your-handle
/.githooks/                 @your-handle

# Tool config (TS). package.json defines the lint, typecheck and test scripts verify runs.
package.json                @your-handle
eslint.config.*             @your-handle
eslint.boundaries.*         @your-handle
tsconfig*.json              @your-handle
.dependency-cruiser.*       @your-handle
vitest.config.*             @your-handle
jest.config.*               @your-handle

# Tool config (Python)
pyproject.toml              @your-handle
.importlinter               @your-handle
conftest.py                 @your-handle
test_core_io.py             @your-handle
